// Signing identity.
//
// A Team ID belongs to an Apple Developer Program membership rather than to a
// person, and an App ID is registered to the team, so everyone on this team
// builds with the values below unchanged. Neither is a credential: signing
// still requires a certificate this file cannot grant.

// Snag Ventures Inc.
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = WTYY8NK83J

PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER = com.meetcorvus.glasses

// Building from outside the team means overriding both -- the bundle id
// included, since an explicit App ID belongs to exactly one team. Put them in
// Signing.local.xcconfig, which is gitignored and wins over everything above
// because it is included last. Changing the bundle id also means re-registering
// with the Meta AI app, and it changes the --domain-identifier used to pull
// session data (see docs/output.md).
#include? "Signing.local.xcconfig"
